  (text "Section 4 of the circuit notes, stage 11. The DSP's Level runs from -40 to +12 dB (chosen): here a volume pot RVX12 and a fixed\n+12 dB stage, UX15 with RX38 and RX39 (chosen). CX18: output coupling (chosen). The DSP's safety limiter has no counterpart." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d7a9b2e7-b53e-5eac-a6c0-6b264cc2d71e"))
